 18 racer fill-gas      \                                          ³
100 racer drive         \                                          ³
                        \                                          ³
    racer tell-gas      \ This command doesn't seem to work        ³
                        \ after doing the above special stuff??? >ÄÙ

slow-poke tell-gas      \ This works just great though???

